    {
      "slug": "long-michael",
      "title": "Long / Michael",
      "request": {
        "text": "Some days, everything feels easy. On other days, even getting started takes effort. That is when a simple routine helps. Decide what matters, prepare your space, and begin before you feel completely ready.\nYou do not have to solve the whole problem in one sitting. Work through the first part, check what you have learned, and adjust your approach. If you make a mistake, use it as information rather than a reason to stop.\nAt the end of the day, look back at the work you actually completed. Keep what helped, change what did not, and leave yourself a clear starting point for tomorrow.",
